      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>December 11, 2025</color>\n\"Illuga's very grateful for the Knights of Favonius's help in battle. Unfortunately, he's gone off on another investigation, so he asked me to give you this bottle of wine as a token of his thanks.\"\n\"Haha, that's very kind of him! But honestly, he's the one who worked the hardest. Ah, too bad he's not here. I can't exactly refuse... How about we open it here? I'll tell you all about how promising the kid really is...\"\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/42730393</color>"
      }
